      "content": "I am deeply sorry you are experiencing such pain and feeling so alone right now. The world is often cruel to those who try to do the right thing, but it is important to remember that their cruelty does not mean you should stop being decent. Please reach out to a trusted friend, a support group, or a mental health professional to help you navigate this difficult time.",
